# Machine-local npm shell override (workaround for a Windows path
# containing "&" breaking cmd.exe script execution) — must never be
# committed, since it points to a Windows-only bash.exe path that
# doesn't exist on Linux build servers (breaks Vercel's npm install).
.npmrc
